            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Riverbond is a fun and frantic couch co-op adventure game for 1 to 4 players set in a stunning voxel world. Embark on a heroic journey to complete missions, battle adorable enemies, and smash everything into tiny cubes! Will you and your friends be the legendary heroes of Riverbond?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons! Combat! Bosses!</h2></strong> Find a ton of melee and ranged weapons in hidden chests and swap them out to suit your play style to defeat enemies and bosses.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objectives!</h2></strong> Each map will challenge you with an objective. Complete this, and you're on your way to becoming the champ!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play alone or with Friends</h2></strong> Riverbond is fully playable in single-player or with up to 4 players in a drop-in/out couch co-op.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Cubic World</h2></strong> Did we mention that you can slash, smash and generally wreak havoc to the charming voxel environments? Go nuts if you want to and experience the awesomeness of real-time physics.<br><br>Who knows what you will find when you explore the depths of Riverbond - there’s only one way to find out. Cue epic adventure music!",
            "about_the_game": "Riverbond is a fun and frantic couch co-op adventure game for 1 to 4 players set in a stunning voxel world. Embark on a heroic journey to complete missions, battle adorable enemies, and smash everything into tiny cubes! Will you and your friends be the legendary heroes of Riverbond?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons! Combat! Bosses!</h2></strong> Find a ton of melee and ranged weapons in hidden chests and swap them out to suit your play style to defeat enemies and bosses.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objectives!</h2></strong> Each map will challenge you with an objective. Complete this, and you're on your way to becoming the champ!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play alone or with Friends</h2></strong> Riverbond is fully playable in single-player or with up to 4 players in a drop-in/out couch co-op.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Cubic World</h2></strong> Did we mention that you can slash, smash and generally wreak havoc to the charming voxel environments? Go nuts if you want to and experience the awesomeness of real-time physics.<br><br>Who knows what you will find when you explore the depths of Riverbond - there’s only one way to find out. Cue epic adventure music!",
            "short_description": "Riverbond is a ‘shoot-and-slash’ dungeon crawler with solo and couch co-op play, set in a stunning voxel world.",
